#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: description
#, no-wrap
msgid ""
"A course for leadership of quantum projects, describing common and best "
"practices."
msgstr ""
"Kursus untuk kepemimpinan proyek kuantum, menjelaskan praktik umum dan "
"terbaik."

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: title
#, no-wrap
msgid "Overview"
msgstr "Ikhtisar"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "{/* cspell:ignore QDAs */}\n"
msgstr "{/* cspell:ignore QDAs */}\n"

#. type: Title #
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Overview {#overview}"
msgstr "Ikhtisar {#overview}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-"
"projects/hero.svg)\n"
msgstr ""
"![\"Hero image\"](/learning/images/courses/designing-and-leading-quantum-"
"projects/hero.svg)\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"This course is designed to assist teams and organizations to effectively "
"build the necessary capabilities to successfully kick-start quantum "
"initiatives. \n"
msgstr ""
"Kursus ini dirancang untuk membantu tim dan organisasi dalam membangun "
"kapabilitas yang diperlukan agar bisa memulai inisiatif kuantum dengan "
"sukses.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recommend devoting approximately 4 hours to completing this content, "
"depending on one's prior experience.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami menyarankan sekitar 4 jam untuk menyelesaikan materi ini, tergantung "
"pengalaman sebelumnya.\n"

#. type: Title ###
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Intended audience {#intended-audience}"
msgstr "Target peserta {#intended-audience}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"We recommend this course for leaders and architects of quantum initiatives, "
"including academic faculty, project leaders in large enterprises, startup "
"leadership, and more. It will be of particular use to organizations new to "
"quantum computing.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kami merekomendasikan kursus ini untuk pemimpin dan arsitek inisiatif "
"kuantum, termasuk staf akademis, manajer proyek di perusahaan besar, "
"pimpinan startup, dan lainnya. Kursus ini sangat berguna bagi organisasi "
"yang baru mengenal komputasi kuantum.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Recommended background {#recommended-background}"
msgstr "Latar belakang yang disarankan {#recommended-background}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"There is no technical prerequisite for this course, but we recommend that "
"learners first take the [Quantum Business "
"Foundations](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations) course, which "
"is a good introduction to the quantum ecosystem.\n"
msgstr ""
"Tidak ada prasyarat teknis untuk kursus ini, tapi kami menyarankan peserta "
"untuk terlebih dahulu mengambil kursus [Quantum Business "
"Foundations](/learning/courses/quantum-business-foundations), yang merupakan"
" pengantar yang bagus untuk ekosistem kuantum.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"If you have questions or concerns regarding this course, please contact the "
"IBM Quantum Learning&reg; team.\n"
msgstr ""
"Jika kamu punya pertanyaan atau kekhawatiran tentang kursus ini, silakan "
"hubungi tim IBM Quantum Learning&reg;.\n"
